<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1361039401"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1489350823"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Do You Mean"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers / Ty Dolla $ign / Bülow"/><amll:meta key="album" value="World War Joy...Takeaway"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:13.187"><div begin="00:10.409" end="03:00.743"><p begin="00:10.409" end="00:12.400" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="00:12.869" end="00:14.746" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2">What you said, no, you can't take away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出口的话没法收回了</span></p><p begin="00:15.248" end="00:19.109" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3">You're my gospel, but I'm losing faith, losing faith<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的福音 但我就要彻底失去信心了</span></p><p begin="00:20.064" end="00:22.091" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="00:22.483" end="00:24.454" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5">Take a minute, do you need to stop and think?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等一下 你要不要停下来好好想想</span></p><p begin="00:24.856" end="00:28.022" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6">What we have, no, we can't throw away, throw away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以放弃现在拥有的一切</span></p><p begin="00:28.115" end="00:30.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Show me that you mean it, aye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="00:30.560" end="00:32.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="00:33.024" end="00:34.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Do you really mean it?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真是这么想的吗</span></p><p begin="00:34.792" end="00:37.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Everything happens for a reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万事皆有因</span></p><p begin="00:37.733" end="00:40.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="00:40.485" end="00:41.567" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L12">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p><p begin="00:42.445" end="00:45.218" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="00:45.298" end="00:46.346" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L14">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p><p begin="00:47.443" end="00:49.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I hope you mean what you say, girl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你说的是真心话 女孩</span></p><p begin="00:49.931" end="00:52.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Hope you ain't lying to my face, girl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你没有当着我的面说谎 女孩</span></p><p begin="00:52.325" end="00:54.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">You said you needed some space, girl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当着我的面说谎</span></p><p begin="00:54.746" end="00:57.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I tried to stay out your way, girl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就尽量离你远一点 女孩</span></p><p begin="00:57.133" end="00:59.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">You heard some stories about my past, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是纠结于我的过去</span></p><p begin="00:59.501" end="01:01.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Wish we could leave them in the past, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真希望过去的事可以一笔勾销</span></p><p begin="01:01.923" end="01:04.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">You said it’s hard for you to trust again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你很难再相信别人了</span></p><p begin="01:04.381" end="01:07.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I wonder if you’re really over it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在想 你真的彻底忘掉过去了吗</span></p><p begin="01:08.669" end="01:11.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Bounce back like a rebound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点振作起来</span></p><p begin="01:13.551" end="01:16.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Are you saying what you mean now?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你现在说的是真心话吗</span></p><p begin="01:17.643" end="01:19.707" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="01:20.128" end="01:22.067" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26">What you said, no, you can't take away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出口的话没法收回了</span></p><p begin="01:22.434" end="01:26.376" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27">You're my gospel, but I'm losing faith, losing faith<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的福音 但我就要彻底失去信心了</span></p><p begin="01:27.247" end="01:29.312" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="01:29.658" end="01:31.765" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29">Take a minute, do you need to stop and think?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等一下 你要不要停下来好好想想</span></p><p begin="01:32.069" end="01:35.237" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30">What we have, no, we can't throw away, throw away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以放弃现在拥有的一切</span></p><p begin="01:35.334" end="01:37.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Show me that you mean it, aye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="01:37.790" end="01:40.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="01:40.187" end="01:41.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Do you really mean it?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真是这么想的吗</span></p><p begin="01:42.011" end="01:44.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Everything happens for a reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万事皆有因</span></p><p begin="01:44.880" end="01:47.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="01:47.701" end="01:48.783" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L36">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p><p begin="01:49.596" end="01:52.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="01:52.447" end="01:53.546" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L38">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p><p begin="01:56.050" end="01:58.146" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L39">Time's up, what you gonna say next?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间快到了 你接下来又要说什么</span></p><p begin="01:58.429" end="02:00.593" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L40">Can’t hide what you did to me, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我做的那些事休想抵赖</span></p><p begin="02:00.904" end="02:02.568" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L41">Put you out like a cigarette<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像掐灭香烟一样果断把你忘掉</span></p><p begin="02:03.265" end="02:05.359" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L42">Put me out of my misery, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我从痛苦中解脱出来的</span></p><p begin="02:05.359" end="02:07.170" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L43">It's not you, it's me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是你 是我自己</span></p><p begin="02:07.452" end="02:09.524" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L44">Come on, seriously<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来 说真的</span></p><p begin="02:09.567" end="02:11.852" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L45">Heard that once or twice before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以前听说过一两次</span></p><p begin="02:12.468" end="02:14.679" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L46">You got that straight from a movie<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是从电影里学到的吧</span></p><p begin="02:15.848" end="02:18.325" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Bounce back like a rebound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点振作起来</span></p><p begin="02:20.744" end="02:23.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Are you saying what you mean now?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你现在说的是真心话吗</span></p><p begin="02:24.913" end="02:26.970" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L49">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="02:27.234" end="02:29.245" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L50">What you said, no, you can't take away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出口的话没法收回了</span></p><p begin="02:29.658" end="02:33.587" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L51">You're my gospel, but I'm losing faith, losing faith<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的福音 但我就要彻底失去信心了</span></p><p begin="02:34.466" end="02:36.626" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L52">Do you mean, do you mean what you say?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你的真心话吗 你的本意是这样的吗</span></p><p begin="02:36.855" end="02:39.072" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L53">Take a minute, do you need to stop and think?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等一下 你要不要停下来好好想想</span></p><p begin="02:39.219" end="02:42.493" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L54">What we have, no, we can't throw away, throw away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以放弃现在拥有的一切</span></p><p begin="02:42.589" end="02:44.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Show me that you mean it, aye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="02:44.946" end="02:47.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="02:47.375" end="02:48.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Do you really mean it?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真是这么想的吗</span></p><p begin="02:49.159" end="02:52.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Everything happens for a reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万事皆有因</span></p><p begin="02:52.124" end="02:54.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="02:54.892" end="02:55.927" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L60">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p><p begin="02:56.927" end="02:59.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Show me that you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你是认真的</span></p><p begin="02:59.692" end="03:00.743" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L62">Do you? Do you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是认真的吗</span></p></div></body></tt>